 a fountain -- Don't you want to go to that land? -- Blue Diamond Mines -- The blind fiddler -- Come on friends and let's go down-- Clara Sullivan's letter -- The High Shefiff of Hazard -- black lung blues -- Black lung -- Black lung paycheck -- The Yablonski murder -- Better times will soon be coming to the hills -- Voices from the mountains -- New day comin' Bright morning stars.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}